          "text": "Testimonies: SAINT-GERMAIN-DU-BEL-AIR (46) 01/24/1985 T1 SAINT-GERMAIN-DU-BEL-AIR (46) 01/24/1985 T2 SAINT-GERMAIN-DU-BEL-AIR (46) 01/24/1985 T3 SAINT-CHAMARAND (46) 01/24/1985 T4",
