          "source_text_sha256": "83ae8827a51c39f595714f7b9d386bdc3cd79e91c250b4654fe6c17ce3395d25",
          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Initial observations of two lightning flashes, followed by the movement of an oval object surrounded by a halo: very likely observations of a meteoroid re-entry.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "32715e378e0cd8e9694f5ff28d9c23ec5b13a61ff40038fcf1e5478ef53a291a"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
